title":"","content":"Sad we didn't get the Eaters of the Dead, but this is pretty cool! Alright, we know some things about the Lodges:<br /> <br /> \u2022They have a unique benefit.<br /> <br /> \u2022They gain an Aspiration and Ban like a pack does. <br /> <br /> \u2022They have access to something called the Lodge Connections Merit.<br /> <br /> \u2022Each will apparently include a list of Fetishes.<br /> <br /> EDIT: They also get <i>a Sacred Hunt benefit.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3514,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","user":"ZealousChristian24","date":". 04-17-2016, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:14:52-07:00","id":867045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> werewolf screaming down the road in a van </div> </div> </div>I have this image of a big rabid Scooby-Doo in a tricked-out Mystery Machine. I doubt most Steel Predators would appreciate the humor of being offered a Scooby Snack...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Is the Rote Quality Blessing for vehicular Drive, Craft and Athletic rolls in addition to or in place of the normal Willpower dice bonuses?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:21:09-07:00","id":867052,"title":"","content":"This Lodge write-up is amazing.<br /> <br /> @Zealous: They also get <i>a Sacred Hunt benefit.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:21:52-07:00","id":867054,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">I live, I die. I LIVE AGAIN!</span></span><br /> <div align=\"center\"><br /> <img src=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/gwTDBQfKN3BTy/giphy.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:26:31-07:00","id":867056,"title":"","content":"I like how the siskur-dah benefit is geared toward making diving off a moving vehicle in gauru form reasonably risk-free.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:29:02-07:00","id":867057,"title":"","content":"On one hand, this is the Lodge I was least excited about seeing. On the other, it's fucking awesome.<br /> <br /> This is the first Werewolf book I've been excited about buying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:30:56-07:00","id":867058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/867031-get-your-motor-running-the-thousand-steel-teeth-werewolf-open-development?p=867056#post867056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like how the siskur-dah benefit is geared toward making diving off a moving vehicle in gauru form reasonably risk-free.</div> </div> </div> </div>Doing so specifically -in gauru- is already relatively risk-free.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:33:33-07:00","id":867060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/867031-get-your-motor-running-the-thousand-steel-teeth-werewolf-open-development?p=867045#post867045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have this image of a big rabid Scooby-Doo in a tricked-out Mystery Machine. I doubt most Steel Predators would appreciate the humor of being offered a Scooby Snack...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Is the Rote Quality Blessing for vehicular Drive, Craft and Athletic rolls in addition to or in place of the normal Willpower dice bonuses?</div> </div> </div> </div> In addition to.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> So yeah, the new Lodge structure revealed. Every Lodge gets a Blessing, Ban and Aspiration, as well as a Sacred Hunt and a Tools section; the latter isn't necessarily fetishes. Lodges are cults; more specifically, they are cults of the <i>hunt.</i><br /> <br /> A little something extra to note - there's an *additional* section for each Lodge of a few hundred words called Mysteries of the (insert Lodge here); these had to be cut due to space but there's an intention to release them as a web supplement. The Mysteries go into weird details about a Lodge, the heresies and blasphemies and strange occultness they engage in. So [REDACTED] believe the second tenet of the Oath of the Moon is false, while the gear dogs concern themselves with the tithe of blood that humanity owes the road spirit courts...<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:35:27-07:00","id":867062,"title":"","content":"The tone is slightly more <i>colossally fucking badass</i> than I expected.<br /> <br /> This is not a complaint.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/959-morkaischosen","name":"MorkaisChosen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"290"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:55:32-07:00","id":867076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>YeOfLittleFaith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/867031-get-your-motor-running-the-thousand-steel-teeth-werewolf-open-development?p=867052#post867052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This Lodge write-up is amazing.<br /> <br /> @Zealous: They also get <i>a Sacred Hunt benefit.</i></div> </div> </div> </div> Right, awesome, I'll fix that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T15:02:31-07:00","id":867085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/867031-get-your-motor-running-the-thousand-steel-teeth-werewolf-open-development?p=867060#post867060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So yeah, the new Lodge structure revealed. Every Lodge gets a Blessing, Ban and Aspiration, as well as a Sacred Hunt and a Tools section; the latter isn't necessarily fetishes. Lodges are cults; more specifically, they are cults of the <i>hunt.</i><br /> <br /> A little something extra to note - there's an *additional* section for each Lodge of a few hundred words called Mysteries of the (insert Lodge here); these had to be cut due to space but there's an intention to release them as a web supplement. The Mysteries go into weird details about a Lodge, the heresies and blasphemies and strange occultness they engage in. So [REDACTED] believe the second tenet of the Oath of the Moon is false, while the gear dogs concern themselves with the tithe of blood that humanity owes the road spirit courts...</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome to hear. All of this. And so glad my favorite of the proposed ones, just by sound at least, was teasered. Really hoping the book comes out soon.<br /> <br /> I'm envisioning Old Smokey as a prestigious outrider for That Which is Broken, a mirror-shaded southern sheriff in a rusted and pitted Pontiac. When he's angry oily black exhaust pours from his mouth with every cursing rant. It probably has a special Numen that allows it to eavesdrop on wireless communications, but a Ban that keeps it from being able to actually outspeed werewolf-driven cars.<br /> <br /> And those fetishes! I can use them already.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T15:19:52-07:00","id":867102,"title":"","content":"&quot;If I'm going to die, I'm going to die historic, on the fury road!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T15:36:47-07:00","id":867118,"title":"","content":"I'm not even that big on Werewolf, and I freaking love this. I've often wondered how to incorporate something like the Orkz from Warhammer 40000 into the CoD. My chants and sacrifices have finally been answered.<br /> <br /> I'm now imagining a Gear Dog who, after one too many beers, starts believing that the red vehicles really do go faster. So he paints his with the blood of his kills, the spirits answer, he runs over more prey, gets redder and faster until he pulls off the Infinite Mass Impact of The Flash right into the ugly mug of an Idigam.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T15:57:24-07:00","id":867131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/867031-get-your-motor-running-the-thousand-steel-teeth-werewolf-open-development?p=867045#post867045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have this image of a big rabid Scooby-Doo in a tricked-out Mystery Machine. I doubt most Steel Predators would appreciate the humor of being offered a Scooby Snack...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Is the Rote Quality Blessing for vehicular Drive, Craft and Athletic rolls in addition to or in place of the normal Willpower dice bonuses?</div> </div> </div> </div>The wording implies the rote action that its in addition to the bonus die. Because the text says &quot;When she spends Willpower to add dice to a..?&quot; And it never says instead of or &quot;before rolling&quot; like how professional training does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10820-blakemikizuki","name":"Blakemikizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T16:24:41-07:00","id":867147,"title":"","content":"Thinking about it, the dexterity bonus means gauru (via the Father's Form, presumably) would be advantageous to drive in. Urhan would be even better on paper, but the lack of thumbs probably introduces a penalty that cancels it out. <br /> <br /> Actually even without TFF it you might be able to swing the logic that driving into an enemy and ramming them off the road satisfies the normal gauru action restrictions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T16:37:20-07:00","id":867160,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/867031-get-your-motor-running-the-thousand-steel-teeth-werewolf-open-development?p=867147#post867147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thinking about it, the dexterity bonus means gauru (via the Father's Form, presumably) would be advantageous to drive in. Urhan would be even better on paper, but the lack of thumbs probably introduces a penalty that cancels it out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Meh, there has to be a Gift or Fetish to compensate for something as mundane as<i> thumbs</i>... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm also trying to imagine a police officer trying to pull over lodge member for something like speeding, failure to signal or not wearing a seatbelt. I shall assume traffic laws and tickets are legitimate Kuruth Triggers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","na